NAME
    gcloud alpha network-management network-monitoring-providers network-paths
        - a Network Path represents the hop-by-hop route and active network
        delivery quality between a Monitoring Point (source) and a target
        destination

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha network-management network-monitoring-providers network-paths
        COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) A Network Path represents the hop-by-hop route and active network
    delivery quality between a Monitoring Point (source) and a target
    destination.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (ALPHA) Describe a Network Path.

     list
        (ALPHA) List Network Paths.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

